  "tekst": "Remote CFO & Accounting Solutions, LLC is a Tampa, Florida-based financial-services business. Florida corporate records show that it was formed in November 2021 and remains an active Florida LLC as of its March 18, 2026 annual filing. Julia Dospehoff is listed as its manager and registered agent, and its principal address is in Tampa (33647). ([search.sunbiz.org](https://search.sunbiz.org/Inquiry/CorporationSearch/GetDocument?aggregateId=flal-l21000488130-2e624945-25aa-449f-880a-4bfffb23ecbb&formatType=PDF&transactionId=l21000488130-a17b9744-6e6b-4621-89f9-f0f2d6471403&utm_source=openai))\n\nThe company appears to provide outsourced accounting and CFO-type services—essentially acting as an external finance/accounting function for businesses rather than requiring them to hire a full-time CFO or accounting staff. There is relatively little detailed public information about its exact service menu; I couldn't find a substantial current company website or public catalog of services. Its name and business listings associate Julia Dospehoff directly with the firm, and third-party professional recommendations describe her as knowledgeable, professional, and detail-oriented. ([alignable.com](https://www.alignable.com/tampa-fl/cti?utm_source=openai))\n\nIn practice, a firm operating under this model would typically help businesses with bookkeeping/accounting oversight, financial reporting, budgeting and forecasting, cash-flow management, and higher-level financial planning. However, those specific services should be viewed as characteristic of the fractional/remote CFO industry rather than confirmed offerings of this particular company. ([finnomic.com](https://finnomic.com/?utm_source=openai))\n\nIf you're looking at them because you're considering hiring them, working for them, or evaluating a charge/transaction involving them, I can also dig further into their owners, online presence, reviews, business history, and whether they appear legitimate.",
